Verify CPU Hardware
ProthLogic5.7 is optimized for CPU with AVX-512 support only.

compile file ./build.sh [profile] [warn]
./build.sh profile  - diagnostic tools
./build.sh warn - wornings while compilation process

Run test.
In Prothlogic5.7 i add new flags to cli, i made some changes to sive 

Flags
--n           N number
--n-start     first N value, flag is used for fixed-k sieve
--n-end       last N value for fixed-k sieve
--k-start     first K to start sieve fixed-N sieve or single number test
--k-end       last K for fixed-N sieve, this value is not necessery for single number test 
--pstart      min 50000000000
--pmax        default p-50000000000
--workers     number of threads per candidat
--max-workers number of workers used to batch mode
--report      in %, default 25%, 0=only result, e.g [STEP] k=843 -> 25% | Max Err: 2.93e-03
--out-primes  out primes to file, default autosave is to primes.txt, put your file name
--out-sieve   out candidates after presieve, put your file name
--in-file     loading candidates to continue presiesieve, or test from file
--sieve-only  abord before FFT proth test
--sparse-sieve 
--detail      flag acivates detiles of actual test 

